{
  "description": "Shared semantic_hash vectors. input_json is the decoded top-level JSON text of a tli1 code. Remove top-level id/createdAt/updatedAt, canonicalize (sorted keys at every depth, compact separators, UTF-8 without ASCII escaping, numbers written as JavaScript JSON.stringify writes them: integer-valued floats and -0 as 0 digits only), then SHA-256 the UTF-8 bytes. Numbers outside the safe range or with exponents are deliberately not covered; the app never emits them.",
